    "summary": "A perennial cycad recorded in Africa, though its native origin is not explicitly stated. It is tree-like, often sprouts extra stems from its base, and bears crowns of leathery, spine-edged leaves. Male and female plants produce separate green cones, while the seeds have bright red coverings.",
