    "summary": "An evergreen shrub native across the Middle East, North Africa and other African regions, southern Europe, the Indian subcontinent and Southeast Asia. It has dull green leaves, small green bell-shaped flowers and orange-red ripe fruit. Its root has centuries of traditional Indian medicinal use, but evidence remains insufficient to confirm the safety or effectiveness of marketed root or leaf supplements.",
